    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11415" root="خلق" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْتَلَقٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلِيقٌ</span>, first sentence, in five
places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Made smooth.</i> (TA.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَلَّقٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Generous in</i> [<i>nature,</i> or] <i>natural
dispositions.</i> (Ham p. 561.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْتَلَقٌ لِلْمُلْكِ</span>, in
a verse of Dhu-r-Rummeh, means <i>Created of a
nature fitting for dominion:</i> (S, TA:) and so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلْأَصْحَابِ</span> [<i>for companions</i>]; as in a verse of
Ibn-Ahmar. (TA.)

